MintCurveConvexPosition::removeCollateral(uint256)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    └── when amount is greater than zero
        ├── given amount exceeds the position's collateral in the market
        │   └── it should revert due to arithmetic underflow
        ├── given the withdrawal would leave the position insolvent
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInsufficientUserCollateral
        └── given the position stays solvent after the withdrawal
            ├── given caller is the owner
            │   ├── it should withdraw amount of collateral from the mint market to the owner
            │   └── it should emit CollateralRemoved
            └── given caller is an authorized spender
                ├── it should withdraw amount of collateral from the mint market to the owner
                └── it should emit CollateralRemoved
